						<r3d:remarks>Description: &quot;As part of the Open Data Pilot that the COEMS EU H2020 project (https://www.coems.eu/) is participating in, COEMS Open Data Portal devotes to collect software and hardware trace data from both academy and industry partners. Our focus lies on the detection and identification of non-deterministic software failures caused by race conditions and access to inconsistent data. Therefore we will provide an efficient real-time access and analysis for operating safe software systems.&quot;
COEMS Team: https://www.coems.eu/team/
